   "texto": [
    "With **du**, the short form is usually used: **Trink Wasser!** (drink water). With **ihr**, the verbal form is used without the pronoun: **Trinkt mehr Wasser!**. With **Sie**, the verb goes first and then **Sie**: **Essen Sie Obst, bitte!** (eat fruit, please).",
